msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Oh, you're gonna like it! Come take a seat, it'll be super relaxing."
msgstr "Oh, tu vas adorer ! Viens t’asseoir, ce sera super relaxant."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh, you're gonna love what I packed for the doors, Z. These cute little guys that you hang on them. You'll see."
msgstr "Oh, tu vas adorer ce que j’ai préparé pour les portes, Z. Ces jolis petits trucs que tu y accroches. Tu verras."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh, you're interested in a challenge, huh? Heh, well I've got one for ya, hun. Readers have been asking for a more... personal POV."
msgstr "Oh, tu aimes les défis, hein ? Hé hé, eh bien j’en ai un pour toi, chéri. Les lecteurs ont demandé un point de vue un peu… plus personnel."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh, you're so adorable... That's okay, sweetheart~ We don't have to talk about it if it makes you uncomfortable~"
msgstr "Oh, tu es si adorable... Ce n’est pas grave, mon chou~ Pas la peine d’en parler si ça te met mal à l’aise~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Heh. Thanks, Exxy. I uh... I guess I can do that! Sure thing."
msgstr "Oh… Heh. Merci, Exxy. Euh… Je suppose que je peux le faire ! Pas de problème."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Heh... Well. I uh... I couldn't tell ya, hun. Deep breaths? If you're too anxious to do it, it's no worries. I get it, I really do."
msgstr "Oh… Heh… Eh bien… Je… Je ne pouvais pas te le dire, ma chérie. Respire profondément ? Si tu es trop anxieux pour le faire, ce n’est pas grave. Je comprends, vraiment."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- I uh... fell."
msgstr "Oh… euh… je suis tombée."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- I... No, never thought of that."
msgstr "Oh… Je… Non, je n’y ai jamais pensé."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Is that... it? I mean- I could use a nice warm shower, I guess."
msgstr "Oh… C’est… ça ? Je veux dire… un bon bain chaud me ferait du bien, je suppose."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Me? Heh- Nah. I'd rather just... be behind the camera, ya know. Wouldn't wanna subject the world to this whole mess, hehe."
msgstr "Oh— Moi ? Hé hé… Non. Je préférerais rester… derrière la caméra, tu sais. Je ne voudrais pas soumettre le monde à tout ce bordel, hé hé."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Oh- My little man doesn't even eat his food before testing it. As if I'd ever poison him. Tsk."
msgstr "Oh ! Mon petit homme ne mange même pas sa nourriture avant de la goûter. Comme si j'allais jamais l'empoisonner. Tss."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Pardon my manners, I'm Zoey."
msgstr "Oh… Pardonnez mes manières, je m’appelle Zoey."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Right. Heh, I'm assuming you've moved to a new spot?"
msgstr "Oh… C’est vrai. Hé, je suppose que tu t’es installé dans un nouvel endroit ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh- Right. You'll want to get fully charged up at a working station?"
msgstr "Oh… C’est vrai. Tu voudras te recharger complètement à une station de service, non ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Secret door. Of course."
msgstr "Oh — une porte secrète. Évidemment."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- They're- Just like that- In an alley- Wow-"
msgstr "Oh… Ce sont… Juste comme ça… Dans une ruelle… Wow…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh, yeah. See ya around then, Cypher."
msgstr "Oh… Euh, ouais. À la prochaine, Cypher."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- No! I- mean- Heh- I don't mean you're not- I mean- Eheh..."
msgstr "Oh— Euh— Non ! Je— veux dire— Heh— Je ne veux pas dire que tu n'es pas— Je veux dire— Eheh..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- Thanks?"
msgstr "Oh… Euh… Merci ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Eheh- No problem!"
msgstr "Oh… Euh… Hé hé… Pas de problème !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Yeah. That's weird."
msgstr "Oh… Euh. Ouais. C’est bizarre."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... He's asking you on a date. Apparently he made eye contact with you one time."
msgstr "Oh... Euh... Il t'invite à sortir. Apparemment, il a croisé ton regard une fois."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... I just did what had to be done to get you that battery."
msgstr "Oh... Euh... J’ai juste fait ce qu’il fallait pour t’obtenir cette batterie."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Oh- We don't have those either-"
msgstr "Oh — On n’a pas ça non plus…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Well I can't read too well, hun. What'd he say in it?"
msgstr "Oh… Eh bien, je ne vois pas très bien, chéri. Qu’est-ce qu’il t’a écrit ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Wow! The bed!"
msgstr "Oh— Wow ! Ce lit !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah that's okay, Z. Sorry, I didn't mean to- I was just- Sorry. I've just been really worried about you, because..."
msgstr "Oh— Oui, ce n’est pas grave, Z. Désolée, je ne voulais pas— Je voulais juste— Pardon. C’est juste que j’ai vraiment eu peur pour toi, parce que…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I don't smoke anymore. Kicked it a while ago."
msgstr "Oh— Ouais, je ne fume plus. J’ai arrêté il y a un moment."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I think I already met her at the Glowing Hole."
msgstr "Oh — oui, je crois que je l’ai déjà rencontrée au Trou Lumineux."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, that's okay."
msgstr "Oh — Ouais, c’est pas grave."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- crap I think someone's lookin'. We gotta make our move now!"
msgstr "Oh merde, je crois qu’on nous regarde ! Il faut qu’on bouge, tout de suite !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- heh, thanks!"
msgstr "Oh… heh, merci !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh- heh. No worries. I've uh... seen worse!"
msgstr "Oh… héhé. Pas de souci. J’ai… vu pire !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- o-okay... So-... Do I-"
msgstr "Oh- o-d'accord... Alors-... Est-ce que-..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh- Heh. I've got a request. Can we-"
msgstr "Oh… euh… héhé. J’ai une petite requête. Est-ce qu’on pourrait…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh... heh- thanks!"
msgstr "Oh... euh... hé hé... merci !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- wow."
msgstr "Oh… wow."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- years at least. Daddy got 'em for me way back when."
msgstr "Oh… des années, au moins. Papa me les a offertes il y a bien longtemps."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Oh-! ... Ohh... You know... I've never had a client complain about one either now that I think about it. Guess that's one good thing, huh?"
msgstr "Oh-! ... Ohh... Tu sais... Je n'ai jamais eu de client qui s'en plaigne, maintenant que j'y pense. C'est sûrement un bon point, non ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Er-"
msgstr "Oh ! Euh…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh- I uh- That's- I'm not-"
msgstr "Oh ! Heh... Je... euh... C'est... Je ne suis pas..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh-..! Erm, thanks! It's all good..!"
msgstr "Oh ! Heh… Euh, merci ! Ce n’est pas grave… !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I can do that! N-No problem!"
msgstr "Oh ! Je peux faire ça ! P-Pas de problème !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I... Thanks!"
msgstr "Oh ! Je... Merci !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-! Okay!"
msgstr "Oh ! D’accord !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! That's... That sounds... nice?"
msgstr "Oh ! Ça... ça a l'air... agréable ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Well, no. I haven't. I would've noticed her. Plus, she would've tripped one of my security systems."
msgstr "Oh ! Eh bien, non. Je ne l'ai pas vue. Je l'aurais remarquée. Et puis, elle aurait déclenché l'un de mes systèmes de sécurité."

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Wow! That's- Wow!"
msgstr "Oh ! Wow ! C'est... Wow !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. I-.. Sorry..! Don't mind me..!"
msgstr "Oh… Je… Je suis désolé… Ne faites pas attention à moi…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. Right..! I'm on it!"
msgstr "Oh… C’est vrai ! J’y vais tout de suite !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry, I'm not here for drinks."
msgstr "Oh… ! Désolée, je ne suis pas là pour boire un verre."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry..! I was going for the wrong door, heh! I- I'm coming!"
msgstr "Oh… ! Désolée… ! Je visais la mauvaise porte, hé ! J-je arrive !"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-... I see...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>Oh... Je vois...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-... I see..."
msgstr "Oh... Je vois..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-... Uh... Th-thanks...!"
msgstr "Oh… Euh… M-merci… !"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-? Um- thanks.</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>Oh ? Euh… merci.</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-? Um- thanks."
msgstr "Oh ? Euh… merci."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh. Yeah, that sucks. Maybe you should take it to a technician?"
msgstr "Oh. Ouais, c’est nul. Tu devrais peut-être l’emmener chez un technicien ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... I uhh-"
msgstr "Oh… Euh…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rosie"
msgid "Oh... My... God... You look amazing!"
msgstr "Oh... Mon... Dieu... Tu es magnifique !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Okay."
msgstr "Oh... D'accord."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Really...?"
msgstr "Oh... Vraiment... ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetheart... Come here..."
msgstr "Oh... ma chérie... Viens ici..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetie... Do you want to talk about it...?"
msgstr "Oh... ma chérie... Tu veux en parler... ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... wow..."
msgstr "Oh... wow..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh...- Uhm-... N-no! Sorry...!"
msgstr "Oh...- Euh... N-non ! Désolée... !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh? It's an old BF-75d. These were everywhere before the crisis!"
msgstr "Oh ? C’est un vieux BF-75d. Il y en avait partout avant la crise !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Oh? Tell us!"
msgstr "Oh ? Dis-nous donc !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck those are some hot milkers, ahaha!"
msgstr "Oh putain, ces traiteuses sont vraiment sexy, ahaha !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck yes..., 'nything you say, babyy'! *hic*"
msgstr "Oh putain oui..., tout ce que tu dis, bébé ! *hoquet*"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh right... *hic* haven't even introduced myself...*hic* name is Cody."
msgstr "Ah oui... *hic* je ne me suis même pas encore présenté... *hic* je m'appelle Cody."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh, okay. That's fine, you already helped me a lot with other stuff."
msgstr "Ohh, d’accord. Pas de problème, tu m’as déjà beaucoup aidé avec d’autres choses."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Ohh-.. She sounds fun. I'll let her book me, hehe."
msgstr "Ohh… Elle a l’air amusante. Je la laisserai me réserver, héhé."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh. Ohhh damn. Hey... *hic* hi there."
msgstr "Ohhh. Ohhh, merde. Hé... *hic* salut."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh... *hic* you"
msgstr "Ohhh... *hic* tu..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh...! That sounds funn!"
msgstr "Ohhh... ! Ça a l’air amusant !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh~ fuck, fuck, fuck~ Yes~ Ooh~ Keep going~ Please~"
msgstr "Ohhh~ putain, putain, putain~ Oui~ Ooh~ Continue~ S’il te plaît~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh~ Holy shit, look at you go~"
msgstr "Ohh~ Putain, regarde-toi donc !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohoho, just teasing, dear~ Look how red you are~!"
msgstr "Ohoho, je te taquine, ma chère~ Regarde comme tu rougis~ !"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohohoh~ Look, Issac. Someone's taking pictures of us."
msgstr "Ohohoh~ Regarde, Isaac. Quelqu'un nous prend en photo."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Eager for head, hm?"
msgstr "Oh~ Impatiente d’avoir une fellation, hein ?"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Zoey~ You're soaked down here~"
msgstr "Oh~ Zoey~ Tu es trempée là-dessous~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Oi, let's go quit screwin' around and find another charging station."
msgstr "Hé, allons-y, arrêtons de tourner en rond et trouvons une autre station de charge."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay darling, we're going to help you get a little more comfortable around me. You're going to go use my shower."
msgstr "D’accord, ma chérie, nous allons t’aider à te sentir un peu plus à l’aise avec moi. Va utiliser ma douche."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I think I found the right port. Move your leg a bit."
msgstr "Bon, je crois que j’ai trouvé le bon port. Bouge un peu la jambe."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I will.</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>D’accord, je le ferai.</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I will."
msgstr "D’accord, je le ferai."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll be right back with your order, sir."
msgstr "D'accord, je reviens tout de suite avec votre commande, monsieur."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll tell him..."
msgstr "D'accord, je vais lui dire..."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I-... I'll try...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>Bon, je... je vais essayer...</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I-... I'll try..."
msgstr "Bon, je... je vais essayer..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I... I guess I can manage that."
msgstr "Bon, je... je suppose que je peux m'en sortir."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, darling."
msgstr "D'accord, mon chéri."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, dear..."
msgstr "D'accord, ma chère..."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, fine-... So...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>Bon, d’accord… Alors…</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, fine-... So..."
msgstr "Bon, d’accord… Alors…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, here. Take a look."
msgstr "D'accord, le voilà. Jette un œil."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, it was my boyfriend who told me."
msgstr "Bon, c’est mon petit ami qui me l’a dit."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, no rush."
msgstr "D’accord, pas de précipitation."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, now how do we..."
msgstr "Bon, maintenant, comment on..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "D’accord, d’accord."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, sounds good."
msgstr "D'accord, ça me va."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, well... Maybe you can ask Lio for help?"
msgstr "Bon, eh bien... Tu pourrais peut-être demander de l’aide à Lio ?"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>D’accord… Mais… Ne le montre pas trop, d’accord ?</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?"
msgstr "D’accord… Mais… Ne le montre pas trop, d’accord ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Z. Sorry for bringing it up. Let's just... get these boxes unpacked, 'kay?"
msgstr "D'accord. C'est bon, Z. Désolée d'en avoir reparlé. On va juste... déballez ces cartons, d'accord ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Zoey. You don't have to say anything. Don't worry. I'm here for you no matter what."
msgstr "D'accord. C'est bon, Zoey. Tu n'as pas besoin de dire quoi que ce soit. Ne t'inquiète pas. Je suis là pour toi, quoi qu'il arrive."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... So you mentioned Felicia used to be an outdoor cat? How long ago was that?"
msgstr "D’accord... Alors, tu as dit que Felicia était une chatte d’extérieur avant ? Ça date de quand, exactement ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... always a pleasure, officers..."
msgstr "Bon... toujours un plaisir, les officiers..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... and what do those ones do...?"
msgstr "Bon... et à quoi servent ceux-là... ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so now what?"
msgstr "Bon... et maintenant, quoi ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so, I just... Start... washing...?"
msgstr "Bon... alors, je... commence... à me laver... ?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay... touchy subject..."
msgstr "Bon... sujet sensible..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay...? And how do I get it open?"
msgstr "D’accord… Et comment je fais pour l’ouvrir ?"

